State: +
  (created as project-level routing table)
  (removed stale EduNexus-specific entries: DEC-001..007, concrete stack refs)
  (removed duplicate navigation entries)
  (added templates references)

Note:
  This file is the project-specific counterpart to root INDEX.sdd.
  Root INDEX.sdd owns system routing; this file owns project routing.
  This file contains SCHEMA and ROUTING only — no concrete project data.
  Concrete project instances are generated per prompt into project/.
  Task instances live under tasks/, decisions under decisions/,
  domain models under domains/, etc. — all project-specific state
  is contained under .sdd/project/, never at root.
